msgstr "Plugin SPANK untuk QRMI {#spank-plugin-for-qrmi}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [SPANK plugin](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-plugins/) for "
"the [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi) is used to "
"configure access to quantum resources from user jobs in a compute "
"environment administrated by the "
"[Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/quickstart.html) workload manager. It "
"handles the acquisition and release of access to quantum resources and sets "
"the necessary environment variables for executing quantum workloads. The "
"available quantum resources are specified in a `qrmi_config.json` file, "
"which is managed by an administrator.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Plugin SPANK](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-plugins/) untuk "
"[Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi) digunakan untuk"
" mengonfigurasi akses ke sumber daya kuantum dari job pengguna di lingkungan"
" komputasi yang dikelola oleh workload manager "
"[Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/quickstart.html). Plugin ini menangani "
"akuisisi dan pelepasan akses ke sumber daya kuantum serta menetapkan "
"variabel lingkungan yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan workload kuantum. "
"Sumber daya kuantum yang tersedia ditentukan dalam file `qrmi_config.json`, "
"yang dikelola oleh administrator.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once installed, this plugin registers the following option. A Slurm user can"
" specify which quantum resources are used for the Slurm job script.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah dipasang, plugin ini mendaftarkan opsi berikut. Pengguna Slurm bisa "
"menentukan sumber daya kuantum mana yang digunakan untuk skrip job Slurm.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For example,\n"
msgstr "Contohnya,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and configuration {#requirements-and-configuration}"
msgstr "Persyaratan dan konfigurasi {#requirements-and-configuration}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following tools are required for the compiling environment:\n"
"* [Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.86 or above\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC (gcc) on Linux and Clang (clang-tools-extra) for Rust unknown targets/cross compilations. QRMI and its SPANK plugin are compatible with a compiler conforming to the C11 standard\n"
"* make/cmake (make/cmake RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* Slurm header files(slurm/slurm.h and so forth) must be available on your host\n"
msgstr ""
"Alat-alat berikut diperlukan untuk lingkungan kompilasi:\n"
"* [Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) versi 1.86 atau lebih baru\n"
"* Kompiler C: misalnya, GCC (gcc) di Linux dan Clang (clang-tools-extra) untuk target unknown Rust/kompilasi silang. QRMI dan plugin SPANK-nya kompatibel dengan kompiler yang sesuai standar C11\n"
"* make/cmake (RPM make/cmake untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"
"* openssl (RPM openssl-devel untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"
"* zlib (RPM zlib-devel untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"
"* File header Slurm (slurm/slurm.h dan sejenisnya) harus tersedia di host kamu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The runtime environment requires:\n"
"* gcc (libgcc RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-libs RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr ""
"Lingkungan runtime memerlukan:\n"
"* gcc (RPM libgcc untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"
"* openssl (RPM openssl-libs untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"
"* zlib (RPM zlib untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure available quantum resources {#configure-available-quantum-"
"resources}"
msgstr ""
"Mengonfigurasi sumber daya kuantum yang tersedia {#configure-available-"
"quantum-resources}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The repository contains an example configuration "
"([`qrmi_config.json.example`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-"
"plugins/blob/main/plugins/spank_qrmi/qrmi_config.json.example)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Repositori ini berisi contoh konfigurasi "
"([`qrmi_config.json.example`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-"
"plugins/blob/main/plugins/spank_qrmi/qrmi_config.json.example)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `resources` array contains a set of available quantum resources. Each "
"quantum resource definition contains the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Array `resources` berisi sekumpulan sumber daya kuantum yang tersedia. "
"Setiap definisi sumber daya kuantum mengandung hal berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Property | Description |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| name | Quantum resource name (for example, backend name) |\n"
"| type | Resource type (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service` and `pasqal-cloud`) |\n"
"| environment | A set of environment variables to work with QRMI. Current implementations assume API endpoint and credentials are specified via environment variable setting |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Properti | Deskripsi |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| name | Nama sumber daya kuantum (misalnya, nama Backend) |\n"
"| type | Tipe sumber daya (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service` dan `pasqal-cloud`) |\n"
"| environment | Sekumpulan variabel lingkungan untuk bekerja dengan QRMI. Implementasi saat ini mengasumsikan endpoint API dan kredensial ditentukan melalui pengaturan variabel lingkungan |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a user specifies a resource with the `--qpu` option that is not defined "
"in the `qrmi_config.json` file, the specification will be ignored.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pengguna menentukan sumber daya dengan opsi `--qpu` yang tidak "
"didefinisikan dalam file `qrmi_config.json`, spesifikasi tersebut akan "
"diabaikan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the user sets the necessary environment variables for job execution "
"themselves, it is not required to specify them in this file. In this case, "
"the environment property will be `{}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pengguna menetapkan variabel lingkungan yang diperlukan untuk eksekusi "
"job sendiri, tidak perlu menentukannya di file ini. Dalam kasus ini, "
"properti environment akan berupa `{}`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you are using a QPU resource with the resource type `qiskit-runtime-service`, use an account that supports [opening a session](/guides/run-jobs-session#open-a-session), such as a Premium Plan account.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika kamu menggunakan sumber daya QPU dengan tipe sumber daya `qiskit-runtime-service`, gunakan akun yang mendukung [pembukaan Session](/guides/run-jobs-session#open-a-session), seperti akun Premium Plan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using an account that does not support opening a session, such as an Open Plan account, add `QRMI_IBM_QRS_SESSION_MODE=\"batch\"` to the environment variable list in qrmi_config.json as aworkaround.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu menggunakan akun yang tidak mendukung pembukaan Session, seperti akun Open Plan, tambahkan `QRMI_IBM_QRS_SESSION_MODE=\"batch\"` ke daftar variabel lingkungan di qrmi_config.json sebagai solusi sementara.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

