msgstr "Logging {#logging}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plugin uses the Slurm logger for logging. Log messages from this plugin"
" can be found in `/var/log/slurm/slurmd.log`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini menggunakan logger Slurm untuk logging. Pesan log dari plugin ini"
" bisa ditemukan di `/var/log/slurm/slurmd.log`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can enable the QRMI runtime log by specifying the following `srun` "
"arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mengaktifkan log runtime QRMI dengan menentukan argumen `srun` "
"berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|  `sbatch`/`srun` option | Slurm log level (SRUN_DEBUG) | QRMI log level (RUST_LOG) |\n"
"| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n"
"| (default) | 3 | info |\n"
"| `--quiet` | 2 | error |\n"
"| `--verbose` | 4 | debug |\n"
"| `-vv` or more | 5 | trace |\n"
msgstr ""
"|  Opsi `sbatch`/`srun` | Level log Slurm (SRUN_DEBUG) | Level log QRMI (RUST_LOG) |\n"
"| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n"
"| (default) | 3 | info |\n"
"| `--quiet` | 2 | error |\n"
"| `--verbose` | 4 | debug |\n"
"| `-vv` atau lebih | 5 | trace |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations for multiple QPUs {#considerations-for-multiple-qpus}"
msgstr "Pertimbangan untuk beberapa QPU {#considerations-for-multiple-qpus}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At runtime, each QRMI instance is linked to a single QPU resource. To enable"
" the use of multiple quantum resources within a single job script, this "
"plugin sets environment variables with the resource name as a prefix. For "
"example, if `--qpu=qpu1,qpu2` is specified, the environment variables will "
"be set as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat runtime, setiap instance QRMI terhubung ke satu sumber daya QPU. Untuk "
"memungkinkan penggunaan beberapa sumber daya kuantum dalam satu skrip job, "
"plugin ini menetapkan variabel lingkungan dengan nama sumber daya sebagai "
"prefiks. Misalnya, jika `--qpu=qpu1,qpu2` ditentukan, variabel lingkungan "
"akan ditetapkan sebagai berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This ensures that each QRMI instance operates with the configuration "
"parameters set for its respective resource during the execution of the Slurm"
" job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini memastikan bahwa setiap instance QRMI beroperasi dengan parameter "
"konfigurasi yang ditetapkan untuk sumber dayanya masing-masing selama "
"eksekusi job Slurm.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The above environment variable settings are applied only to jobs where the "
"`--qpu=names` option is specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan variabel lingkungan di atas hanya diterapkan pada job yang opsi "
"`--qpu=names`-nya ditentukan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plugin also sets the following two environment variables, which are "
"referred by the QRMI primitives code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini juga menetapkan dua variabel lingkungan berikut, yang dirujuk "
"oleh kode primitif QRMI.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Environment variable | Description |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_RESOURCES` | Comma-separated list of QPU resources to use at runtime. Undocumented resources will be filtered out. For example, `qpu1,qpu2` |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_TYPES` | Comma-separated list of resource type (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service`, and `pasqal-cloud`). For example, `direct-access,pasqal-cloud` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variabel lingkungan | Deskripsi |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_RESOURCES` | Daftar sumber daya QPU yang dipisahkan koma untuk digunakan saat runtime. Sumber daya yang tidak terdokumentasi akan difilter. Misalnya, `qpu1,qpu2` |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_TYPES` | Daftar tipe sumber daya yang dipisahkan koma (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service`, dan `pasqal-cloud`). Misalnya, `direct-access,pasqal-cloud` |\n"
